    "name": "abilities",
    "audience": "private art: drawn only inside a seat's own open private sheet",
    "loadPolicy": "Every player phone, once, with the player bundles (public-board, player-ui, roles), before the first match view, whatever the seat's role, state or turn. The table display does not load it. Which requests a phone makes says nothing about its role."
  },
